        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should be resolved on latest `main`. Any call to `move_cursor()` adds previous position to jumplist. This approach aligns with other modules that add to jumplist. If it will be decided that this is too much (and adding to jumplist should be done only if jumping to another line), it will be easier to adjust in all modules.\n\nThanks again for the suggestion!",
